<span style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#111;">3,95&nbsp;%</span>
<span style="font-size:13px;color:#2e7d32;">&#9650; +9 pb</span>
<span style="font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-left:auto;">QUOTIDIEN &nbsp;|&nbsp; 8-24 SEPT.</span>
</div>
